    LLM: 'Wall Street: 4 community cards face-up costing 1/2/3/4 units. Each round: buy a community card (fee to pot, card replaced from deck) OR get free face-up card. Continue until 4 upcards each. Final card dealt face-down. Standard betting rounds. Best 5-card hand wins.',
    Player: 'Wall Street: 4 community cards face-up costing 1/2/3/4 units. Each round: buy a community card (fee to pot, card replaced from deck) OR get free face-up card. Continue until 4 upcards each. Final card dealt face-down. Standard betting rounds. Best 5-card hand wins.',
